Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 07:33:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: risk/compliance audit trail and firm-wide compliance
 dashboard

Model fields (risk_level, compliance_flag on Project) already existed from
last session. This pass closes the remaining gap from the risk/compliance
brief: a queryable audit trail and a firm-wide read layer.

- routes/projects.py: risk_level and compliance_flag changes on update
  now get a distinctly-actioned 'project_risk_changed' ActivityLog entry
  (previously only status changes were called out in the free-text
  description of a generic 'project_updated' entry).
- routes/projects.py: new GET /projects/{id}/history endpoint -- the
  engagement's ActivityLog entries, newest first, as a lightweight audit
  log without a separate audit table.
- routes/reports.py: new GET /reports/dashboard/compliance -- firm-wide
  rollup of open engagements that are high/medium risk or carry a
  compliance flag, with overdue task counts and recent risk changes.
- src/lib/api.js: fetchProjectHistory, fetchComplianceDashboard helpers.
- 14 new tests (backend/tests/test_risk_compliance.py), 158 total passing.

No migration needed -- reuses existing risk_level/compliance_flag columns
and the existing ActivityLog table.
